### EXP War Axe Control (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Brute Force Breastplate, Oracle, Dominance Ice, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Brute Force Breastplate, Oracle
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use into physical EXP lanes when slows and crowd control are not the main reason X.Borg loses armor.; Ice Queen Wand over Dominance Ice when Use when your team lacks slows and X.Borg needs every Fire Missiles tag to keep short-range enemies inside the burn.; Antique Cuirass over Dominance Ice when Use when repeated physical skill damage breaks Firaga Armor before X.Borg can collect supplies.; Athena's Shield over Dominance Ice when Use against one-shot magic burst that can erase the real body after Firaga Armor drops.
- Total cost: 10660 gold

Default EXP setup for long front-to-back fights where X.Borg stacks War Axe and Brute Force before converting repeated fire into objective control.

### EXP Vengeance Frontline (EXP)

